OL,3,GNEWSASeal sanctuary takes in first pup
OL,4,Aof the season
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seal sanctuary has taken in its first
OL,7,Fpup of the season, a grey female it has
OL,8,Fnamed Babybel.
OL,10,FMammal medics from the British Divers
OL,11,FMarine Life Rescue had monitored the
OL,12,Fpup for 48 hours before stepping in to
OL,13,Frescue it when its mother did not
OL,14,Freturn to nurse and it became
OL,15,Fincreasingly weak.
OL,17,FThe pup thought to be about seven days
OL,18,Fold was rescued at Port Gaverne on 6
OL,19,FAugust and taken to the Cornish Seal
OL,20,FSanctuary.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
