OL,3,GNEWSASeal sanctuary takes in first pup
OL,4,Aof the season
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeth Goodridge, animal care specialist
OL,7,Fat the charity, said it was "really
OL,8,Fpleased with the progress she is
OL,9,Fmaking" adding her jobs now included
OL,10,F"eating, sleeping and growing".
